  "summary": "Rate 1-5: I communicate purpose; I listen; I delegate clearly; I invite challenge; I make fair decisions; I give feedback; I manage conflict; I admit mistakes; I support learning; I protect team capac",
  "explanation": "### Questions\nRate 1-5: I communicate purpose; I listen; I delegate clearly; I invite challenge; I make fair decisions; I give feedback; I manage conflict; I admit mistakes; I support learning; I protect team capacity; I follow through; I develop others.\n\n### Scoring\n48-60 indicates a strong foundation; 36-47 indicates developing competence; 24-35 suggests focused practice; below 24 suggests beginning with reliability, listening, and clarity. This is a reflection tool, not a formal assessment.\n\n### Prompts\nWhen did I influence without authority? Where do I micromanage? Which conversation am I avoiding? How do my decisions affect less powerful people? What behavior will I practice this week?",
